{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CrystalGraphRealization"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.canonical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.canonical","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L73-L98","doc":"**The trivial model — a `def`, not an `instance`, and not \"faithful\".**\n\nIts docstring said *\"Faithful instance. Carries the explicit research-grade\nconjecture as a sorry.\"* Neither half was true. There is no `sorry`: it sets\n`confLevel _ := 0` and `klrTopDegree _ := 0`, so `filtrations_agree` is\ndischarged by `rfl` on `0 = 0`. That is strictly worse than a `sorry`,\nbecause a `sorry` is visible to `#print axioms` and this is not.\n\nAs an unconditional `instance` it was supplied by typeclass resolution for\nevery `R` and `q`, which made `confLevel_le_klrTopDegree` and\n`klrTopDegree_le_confLevel` unconditional theorems about a filtration pair\nthat is identically zero — `conj:confinement-grading-correspondence`\nasserted nothing.\n\nSame shape as `SpectralSequence.canonicalTrivial` and demoted the same way\n(bean `qou-fngs`, checker `check-self-discharging-instances.ts`). The model\nstays available and must now be named, so a reader of a downstream theorem\ncan see whether the hypothesis was discharged by real filtrations or by\nzero. Nothing consumed it: the class had no users outside this file. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.klrTopDegree_le_confLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.klrTopDegree_le_confLevel","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L59-L71","doc":"Unconditional consequence (reverse direction): the KLR top degree\nis upper-bounded by the confinement filtration.  Together with\n`confLevel_le_klrTopDegree` this packages `filtrations_agree` as\na two-sided ≤ pair, the form most often used in proofs about the\nGS shadow-price filtration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.confLevel_le_klrTopDegree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.confLevel_le_klrTopDegree","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L48-L57","doc":"Unconditional consequence: the confinement filtration is upper-\nbounded by the KLR top degree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.filtrations_agree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.filtrations_agree","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L43-L43","doc":"**The conjecture itself**: the two filtrations agree on the\nnose.  Plays the role of `sorry`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.klrTopDegree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.klrTopDegree","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Top non-zero graded degree of the KLR-module lift `M_K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.confLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.confLevel","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Confinement level `ℓ(K, q)` of a normal form (LP shadow-price\nfiltration). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementGradingCorrespondence","kind":"class","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.lean#L27-L44","doc":"**Confinement / KLR-grading correspondence (conjecture).**\n\nEncodes the equality of two filtrations on `H_n(R, q)`: the LP\nshadow-price confinement filtration and the KLR ℤ-grading top-\ndegree filtration. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:confinement-grading-correspondence","label":"conj:confinement-grading-correspondence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}